{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"componentIndex","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":" { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Storages address their per-type state and the per-entity component bitset by this value."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The default implementation assigns indices lazily: the first access of a type takes the next free index"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of the process, later accesses look it up in a thread-safe table. The index is process-wide, not per ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so all nexuses of a process agree on it. Indices are dense (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0 ..< n"},{"text":" for ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"n"},{"type":"text","text":" types used so far) and unbounded."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"They depend on the order of first use and are not stable between process launches;"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"use "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/RegistrableComponent\/stableIdentifier"},{"text":" for persistent data.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Swift has no stored static properties in generic types, so a plain conformance can not cache its index in a static.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Provide your own implementation (the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Component"},{"text":" macro will) as a stored ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"static let"},{"text":" for a plain load,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"but only if you can guarantee that two types never share an index and that it is in ","type":"text"},{"code":"0 ..< 1_048_576","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Indices are process-wide: a hand-assigned index must not collide with a lazily assigned one of another type."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A collision or an index out of range traps at first use of the type in a nexus.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"O(1)","type":"text"}]}],"style":"note","name":"Complexity"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Component\/componentIndex-5oxlf"},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"metadata":{"title":"componentIndex","symbolKind":"property","extendedModule":"FirebladeECS","roleHeading":"Type Property","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:12FirebladeECS9ComponentPAAE14componentIndexSivpZ","modules":[{"name":"FirebladeECS"}],"fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"componentIndex","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/component\/componentindex-5oxlf"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Component"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The dense index of this component type."}],"references":{"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/Component":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Component","abstract":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Component"}]}],"title":"Component","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Component"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Component"}],"url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/component","type":"topic"},"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/RegistrableComponent/stableIdentifier":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/RegistrableComponent\/stableIdentifier","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The stable identifier of this component type, derived from "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/RegistrableComponent\/componentTypeName","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"title":"stableIdentifier","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"stableIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12FirebladeECS25StableComponentIdentifierV","text":"StableComponentIdentifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/registrablecomponent\/stableidentifier","type":"topic"},"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/Component/componentIndex-5oxlf":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Component\/componentIndex-5oxlf","type":"topic","title":"componentIndex","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The dense index of this component type."}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"componentIndex"},{"ki